[37.789, "o", "\u001b[33m        bot so far: 202 guesses | 94 reached the app | 108 stopped by AEGIS | real accounts found: 2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.39, "o", "  \u001b[2m+  27s\u001b[0m live      shadow: PASSED  2042 live requests; suspected FPs 0/1956 (+0 indeterminate, actors with <3 requests) non-campaign requests (al\r\n"]
[39.39, "o", "  \u001b[2m+  27s\u001b[0m live      canary: PASSED  12s at 25%: no regression; rule blocked 114 requests from actors the observer flags as attackers and 0 from un\r\n  \u001b[2m+  27s\u001b[0m ENFORCED  aegis-credential_stuffing-1 is now blocking\r\n"]
[40.992, "o", "\u001b[33m        bot so far: 226 guesses | 94 reached the app | 132 stopped by AEGIS | real accounts found: 2\u001b[0m"]
[40.992, "o", "\r\n"]
[44.195, "o", "\u001b[33m        bot so far: 251 guesses | 94 reached the app | 157 stopped by AEGIS | real accounts found: 2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.397, "o", "\u001b[33m        bot so far: 276 guesses | 94 reached the app | 182 stopped by AEGIS | real accounts found: 2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[50.599, "o", "\u001b[33m        bot so far: 301 guesses | 94 reached the app | 207 stopped by AEGIS | real accounts found: 2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.9, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[5/5]\u001b[0m \u001b[1mWhat happened\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.904, "o", "  rule enforcing \u001b[1;32m27s\u001b[0m after the attack began, with no human involved\r\n  the bot made 307 guesses: \u001b[1m94\u001b[0m reached the app, \u001b[1;32m213\u001b[0m were stopped by AEGIS\r\n  real accounts the bot cracked before the rule: 2 (admin@booknook.test, ada@booknook.test)\r\n  a real user logging in while the rule is live: HTTP 200 (works)\r\n  ordinary visitors blocked by an AEGIS rule: \u001b[1;32m0\u001b[0m of 8,476 requests\r\n"]
[51.904, "o", "  AEGIS also investigated 6 other alerts (ordinary visitors with odd searches, and the bot's side effects) and made \u001b[1m0\u001b[0m rules for them\r\n\u001b[2m\r\n  (gate windows shortened to 8s + 12s for this demo; defaults are 30s + 45s)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.904, "o", "\u001b[32m$ aegis stop\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.026, "o", "  stopped. (Your app is unchanged and reachable directly - AEGIS only proxied it.)\r\n"]
